dinov3/ = cloned official DINOv3 repo. Weights in dino/: ViT-L LVD-1689M (used everywhere), ConvNeXt-L (convnext/),
ConvNeXt-B and ViT-L SAT-493M (satellite; downloaded 2026-10-22, not used yet).

train_dino_classifier.py: frame classifier (backbone + MLP head) on the hand-picked cropped frames. Original classifiers:
lr 5e-6, bs 2, 15 ep, StepLR@10, --complex_augs, unfrozen. Optional --lr_schedule cosine, --distance_scale_weight,
--grad_checkpointing (bs 16 in ~7GB).
train_dino_mil.py: binary gated-attention MIL over frame bags, optional --classifier_checkpoint init.
train_dino_transformer.py: transformer aggregator (DinoSelfAttention, head shared with convnext/ via transformer/model.py)
over 32-frame bags; --random_segment_sample (default in baseline v2) or --cluster_sample; dense patch-token path via
--dense_adapter/--dense_tokens. Saves architecture_config.json; load with DinoSelfAttention.from_checkpoint(run_dir).
hp_sweep.py: transformer HP grid search on split_1 (hp_sweep_results_merged.csv), args from build_parser().
vis_attention.py / vis_video_results.py / vis_classifier_attention.py: per-video attention plots / per-video prediction
CSVs for several model types (incl. convnext_transformer) / occlusion heatmaps (5-class scored by P(grade >= 2)).
utils.py: backbone loading, MLP head, transforms.

Removed experiments (git history):
- train_dino_transformer_rope.py (RoPE on frame position in the original video): 5 splits mean QWK ~0.80, abandoned.
- train_dino_transformer_alt_sampling.py (hierarchical anchors x regions): never finished an epoch.
- vis_mil_results.py, full_evaluation.py: replaced by vis_video_results.py. Last binary MIL 4-way eval (split 1):
  PR-AUC / F1 / acc max-attention frame 0.974/0.831/0.776, uniform 32 0.979/0.900/0.897, all frames 0.972/0.900/0.897,
  10x ensemble 0.973/0.900/0.897.
- --unfreeze_epoch, --drop_path_rate, --label_smoothing (removed 2026-10-18, results below).

2026-10-17: fine-tuned backbone (bv2 args without --freeze_backbone, x0.1, 18 ep cosine, split 1): QWK 0.874, acc 0.733,
F1 0.667, RR 0.909 vs frozen 0.848/0.683/0.646/0.848; ~19 min/epoch, 10.7GB (autocast + grad checkpointing).
Splits 2/3: 0.849/0.827 (frozen 0.885/0.858), peak at ep 3/2 then overfit. 3-split mean QWK 0.850 vs 0.864, RR 0.918 vs 0.866.
--ffn_dim 1024 vs 2048: no real difference.
2026-10-18: overfit fixes (splits 2/3): x0.03 -> 0.845/0.788 (no help); drop_path 0.1 + label smoothing 0.1 -> 0.801/0.853.
Head warm-up --unfreeze_epoch 3: mean QWK 0.851 (no gain). Frozen stays best QWK.
No classifier init (pretrained DINOv3, ConvNeXt HPs): QWK 0.827, RR 0.758; with warm-up 0.823 -> classifier stage matters.
2026-10-21: baseline v2 (frozen, cosine, random-segment, combined = QWK+RR+acc), 5 splits: QWK 0.871/0.859/0.856/0.864/0.749,
mean 0.840 +- 0.051, acc 0.642, F1 0.552, RR 0.877 +- 0.062. ConvNeXt baseline 0.849 +- 0.039, RR 0.846 - tie.
Paxos2020 mixing (split 1): QWK 0.885, RR 0.879 vs 0.871/0.818 (one fold).
2026-10-21: 5-split video-level eval vs classifier ensembles: QWK Clf 0.767, Clf32 0.774, DINO 0.840, ConvNeXt 0.849
(data/multi_eval_paxos2025_baselines).
2026-10-21: dense patch tokens (split 1, frozen bv2 args), best QWK/RR: attnpool1 0.860/0.909, attnpool4 0.867/0.939,
grid2 0.850/0.879, grid4 0.888/0.879 vs CLS 0.871/0.818. Late epochs noisier. Within noise on one fold.
Position probe: frozen patch tokens encode (row, col) linearly (ridge R2 0.996/0.994, MAE ~0.5 patch) -> added --no_adapter_pe.
2026-10-22: dense ablations (split 1): grid4 maxpool 0.860/RR 0.879 (avg 0.888), attnpool4 no PE 0.846/0.879 (PE 0.867/0.939);
without classifier init 0.685 and 0.774. Keep avg pooling + PE. Open: attnpool4 on splits 2-5.
2026-10-22: classifier cosine + CDW 0.2 (bs 2, 5 splits): frame-level QWK 0.765 vs 0.750, last epoch 0.754 vs 0.708 (stable late);
bs 16 underfits (0.682). Video level (data/multi_eval_paxos2025_clfcos): Clf 0.798 vs 0.767, Clf32 0.729 vs 0.774;
transformers still +0.04-0.05 (Clf) / +0.11-0.12 (Clf32).
